			"notes": "# Movie Update\nFor this new release, we remade the entire mod. From its core.\n\nFrom how you get in the Backrooms, to how you suffer in it.\n\nAdditionally, you can watch [**How to go to the Backrooms 2!!!!**](https://youtu.be/-VkMN4puihs)\n\n## Changelog\n- Captain Ruthie structure\n- Backrooms Portal block\n- \"Fake Block\" block\n- `backrooms:full_immersion` gamerule (see *Full Immersion*)\n- `backrooms:limited_chatting` gamerule (see *Limited Chatting*)\n- Marked Concrete has all letters from A to Z\n- New model for the camera item renamed to \"Camcorder\"\n- 20 unique rooms in Level 0\n- Removed all other levels (for now)\n\n## Full Immersion\nThe `backrooms:full_immersion` gamerule adds lots of effects and features to the mod to improve its immersion, like nyctophobia, inventory swapping, darkness when travelling from dimensions, noclipping...\n\nIt is enabled by default, when creating a new world.\n\n## Limited Chatting\nThe `backrooms:limited_chatting` is effective only in multiplayer, this makes it so that chat messages are only visible in a certain radius when players are in Level 0\n\nAll other players won't receive it, won't heard you.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/V-Fast/BackroomsMod/compare/v1.0.0...v2.0.0"
		},
