			"notes": "# Full Release\nAfter 2 years of creation, and of inspiration. The Backrooms Mod releases completely.\n\n## 1.21 Rewrite\nThe code has been almost fully reset to start again with clean and updated code. Most of the old content has been scrapped like weapons, entities, and other... (These removed things aren't listed in the Changelog unless mentionned)\n\n## Changelog\n- Added an \"Immersion Level\" to Music Tapes\n- Changed how the Level 0 generation works via Structure Blocks and Jigsaw Blocks, built natively in the game.\n- Changed all Level 0 structures, made by PatateGivrée\n- Changed internal tools for the Tape Player\n- Music Tapes have been reset, there are now 2 to begin with:\n  - Paper Birch (Whitepine OST) - Ivory\n  - Empyrea - Ivory\n- Contributors have been updated\n- Credits have been updated\n- Now needs only 1 dependency being [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/V-Fast/BackroomsMod/compare/v0.2.1...v1.0.0"
		},
