			"notes": "# Overview\nThis version mostly overhauls existing content, and changes many mechanics to make it closer to the general canon.\n\n# General\n- Removed normal portals, you can now travel to the Backrooms by crafting a portal block, suffocating, or waiting ~30 minutes :)\n- Overhauled Level 0 generation, now, the world goes only up to layer 16, and there is wiring on the top of level.\n- You can escape by locating random portals scattered throughout the level.\n- Added Spanish & Russian translations.\n- Added achievments.\n- The entity's speed has been adjusted slightly.\n- The chests now contain more varied loot\n- Many other changes I may have forgotten.\n\n# Technical Changes\nThe version number has been flattened to make everything simpler. Also, the package name has been changed from com.lumination to org.vfast"
